> > SYNTAX TEST "Packages/Carve/Carve.sublime-syntax"

A quoted item two deep owns a `> > +` below it, right below or after blank
`> >` lines, when a quoted block two deep follows. This file's assertion token
is `> >` so the assertion line is that block.

> > - a
> > +
> > ^ markup.quote.carve markup.list.continuation.carve punctuation.definition.list.continuation.carve
> > b

> > - a
> >
> > +
> > ^ markup.quote.carve markup.list.continuation.carve punctuation.definition.list.continuation.carve
> > b

> > - a
> >
> >
> > +
> > ^ markup.list.continuation.carve
> > b

> > 1. a
> >
> > +
> > ^ markup.list.continuation.carve
> > b

A blank line one deep ends the item's watch, and a `> > +` below an item one
deep is text.

> > - a
>
> > +
> > ^ -markup.list.continuation.carve
> > b

> - a
>
